Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.73,0:00:06.27,Default,Chloe,0,0,0,,Regarding the request for capturing a \Nthunder dragon, that's been retracted.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.55,0:00:09.94,Default,Chloe,0,0,0,,He said that chicken\Nis actually "much tastier,"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.94,0:00:15.29,Default,Chloe,0,0,0,,and that he'll never forget \Nabout you until he forgets...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.53,0:00:19.80,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,So that's the message from Thousand Tricks?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.11,0:00:22.37,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,Will his mockery never end?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.37,0:00:24.66,Default,Eigh,0,0,0,,Arnold, please calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.66,0:00:26.85,Default,Eigh,0,0,0,,This is playing right into his hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.85,0:00:27.53,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.94,0:00:29.56,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,A silly provocation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.56,0:00:30.63,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,Anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.63,0:00:32.02,Default,Chloe,0,0,0,,Well, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.02,0:00:32.78,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.78,0:00:35.29,Default,Chloe,0,0,0,,Regarding his impression of you, Arnold...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.29,0:00:37.24,Default,Chloe,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry! It's nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.24,0:00:38.11,Default,Juster,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.11,0:00:39.04,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,Say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.20,0:00:42.88,Default,Chloe,0,0,0,,H-He said you like... big boobs...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.88,0:00:44.30,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,Am I hearing this right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.30,0:00:45.86,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,Say it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.35,0:00:56.24,Default,Chloe,0,0,0,,"Arnold Hail is a level 7 big boob lover!"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.65,0:00:56.24,Default,Woman,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.24,0:00:57.18,Default,Per1,0,0,0,,Did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.18,0:00:58.65,Default,Per2,0,0,0,,So he's just a perv?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.65,0:01:01.19,Default,Per3,0,0,0,,Well, he looks the part.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.19,0:01:05.63,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,We are now in the golden \Nage of big boob lovers!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.97,0:01:09.66,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,Among the countless big boob lovers \Nin the capital of Zebrudia,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.66,0:01:13.28,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,there is one big boob lover who \Nstands out amongst all others!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.28,0:01:17.31,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,His name is the Dragon Slayer \NCrashing Thunder Arnold Hail!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.31,0:01:19.65,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,Everyone's talking smack\Nabout the Falling Fog now!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.65,0:01:23.87,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,Will the time when they can \Nrestore their honor ever come?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.23,0:01:59.96,Default,Ark,0,0,0,,This way, Lady Éclair.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.96,0:02:03.00,Default,Ecl,0,0,0,,Wow, so this is your clan house, Ark?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.00,0:02:04.62,Default,Ecl,0,0,0,,I suppose it's somewhat spacious.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.62,0:02:06.69,Default,Arc,0,0,0,,Well, no. I don't own this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.68,0:02:09.69,EpTitle,txt,0,0,0,,{\c&H00BAFF&\pos(320.52,100.623)}Episode 12
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.68,0:02:09.69,EpTitle,txt,0,0,0,,{\fs30\bord3\pos(322.143,238.714)\c&HD1D1D1&}If Possible, I'd Like to Get It
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.69,0:02:09.04,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,"If Possible, I'd Like to Get It."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.37,0:02:28.12,Show Title,txt,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,700)\pos(324,269)\fscx95\fscy76}Let This Grieving Soul Retire
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.76,0:02:45.55,Default,Eigh,0,0,0,,Thousand Tricks is impossible to read.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.55,0:02:47.76,Default,Eigh,0,0,0,,Once that gravity magic wore off,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.76,0:02:49.82,Default,Eigh,0,0,0,,we were essentially unscathed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.82,0:02:52.98,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,He continues to provoke and incite us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.98,0:02:56.87,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,And to top it off, he wants us to fight \Nagainst his clan's strongest parties?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.05,0:03:00.19,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,What the hell is his objective?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.19,0:03:01.51,Default,Eigh,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.51,0:03:03.94,Default,Eigh,0,0,0,,I've never met a hunter like that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.94,0:03:05.00,Default,Juster,0,0,0,,I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.00,0:03:06.53,Default,Eigh,0,0,0,,Oh. Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.10,0:03:08.36,Default,Eigh,0,0,0,,So, how'd it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.36,0:03:09.53,Default,Juster,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.88,0:03:11.11,Flashback,Sven,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.11,0:03:13.79,Flashback,Sven,0,0,0,,We don't get into meaningless fights.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.79,0:03:14.69,Flashback,Juster,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.79,0:03:18.55,Sign,txt,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fs20\pos(133.68,10.991)}Obsidian Cross
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.69,0:03:17.67,Flashback,Sven,0,0,0,,I'm guessing Krai tricked you into this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.67,0:03:18.55,Flashback,Sven,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.55,0:03:20.54,Flashback,Sven,0,0,0,,I'll buy you a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.25,0:03:24.54,Flashback,Kris,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me, honestly?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.55,0:03:29.81,Sign,txt,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fs20\pos(519.966,89.848)}Starlight
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.89,0:03:29.82,Flashback,Kris,0,0,0,,Why would we ever fight for the sake\Nof some weakling human? Honestly!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.82,0:03:31.01,Flashback,Juster,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.01,0:03:34.81,Flashback,Lapis,0,0,0,,We do not serve that man.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.14,0:03:37.05,Flashback,Lapis,0,0,0,,We will not be a stepping stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.56,0:03:40.06,Flashback,Isabella,0,0,0,,Huh? What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.06,0:03:41.34,Flashback,Juster,0,0,0,,Isn't it obvious?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.07,0:03:46.58,Sign,txt,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fs20\pos(136.68,96.991)}Ark Brave
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.34,0:03:41.98,Flashback,Isabelle,0,0,0,,Are you stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.98,0:03:45.21,Flashback,Yuu,0,0,0,,You shouldn't take his words at face value.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.21,0:03:46.56,Flashback,Isabella,0,0,0,,Are you dumb?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.10,0:03:50.34,Default,Juster,0,0,0,,I got basically the same\Nanswer from each of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.11,0:03:53.15,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,What the hell is wrong with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.15,0:03:55.83,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,He's their clan master,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.20,0:03:57.97,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,and {\i1}that's{\i0} how they see him?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.19,0:04:01.79,Default,Eigh,0,0,0,,Arnold, let's take a step back for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.79,0:04:02.71,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.71,0:04:05.27,Default,Eigh,0,0,0,,Seems there's a big auction \Ncoming up soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.27,0:04:07.46,Default,Eigh,0,0,0,,We could get our hands on some new gear
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.46,0:04:09.29,Default,Eigh,0,0,0,,and maybe even sell that thing we have,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.29,0:04:11.59,Default,Eigh,0,0,0,,the one they refused to appraise \Nback in the Land of Fog...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.59,0:04:13.97,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,You mean that strange relic?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.97,0:04:16.84,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,Well, maybe we can at least\Nget some drinking money out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.47,0:04:19.63,Internal,Arnold(M),0,0,0,,Thousand Tricks...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.63,0:04:21.95,Internal,Arnold(M),0,0,0,,Just this once, I'll leave it be.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.95,0:04:23.56,Internal,Arnold(M),0,0,0,,Just this once!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.62,0:04:29.12,Default,Matthis,0,0,0,,This relic... Miss, did you find it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.12,0:04:30.15,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.15,0:04:34.53,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Master told me there was one over \Nat the Alleyne Pillars Ruins.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.53,0:04:35.51,Default,Matthis,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.51,0:04:38.12,Default,Matthis,0,0,0,,That's a level 1 vault, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.43,0:04:40.67,Default,Matthis,0,0,0,,Those rarely have any relics.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.67,0:04:43.12,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Well, Tino did try her best.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.34,0:04:46.01,Default,Matthis,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, this is an extraneous relic.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.01,0:04:49.24,Default,Matthis,0,0,0,,A different type than the ones\N usually found in vaults.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.24,0:04:52.18,Default,Matthis,0,0,0,,It's probably something from a highly \Nadvanced magic civilization.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.15,0:04:55.81,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,So, what's it do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.81,0:04:57.39,Default,Matthis,0,0,0,,You fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.59,0:05:01.22,Default,Matthis,0,0,0,,If one could tell without activating it,\Nappraisers would be doomed!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.22,0:05:04.12,Default,Matthis,0,0,0,,Sorry, Miss, but I'm going \Nto have to keep this for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.56,0:05:09.65,Default,Matthis,0,0,0,,With the auction coming up, I'm\Ndrowning in appraisal requests.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.95,0:05:11.89,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.89,0:05:14.42,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,So, can I finally see 'em?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.42,0:05:17.45,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,The relics that will go up for \Nauction are in the back, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.88,0:05:19.03,Default,Matthis,0,0,0,,You brat...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.03,0:05:20.54,Default,Matthis,0,0,0,,So that's why you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.18,0:05:22.40,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,My admission ticket.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.40,0:05:23.41,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.88,0:05:25.85,Default,Matthis,0,0,0,,I don't have time for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.85,0:05:28.37,Default,Matthis,0,0,0,,Have a quick look and get outta here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.37,0:05:29.94,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.94,0:05:32.38,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Why don't you just chat with Tino?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.38,0:05:34.03,Default,Matthis,0,0,0,,Sheesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.03,0:05:36.16,Default,Matthis,0,0,0,,Miss, are the hunts going well?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.16,0:05:37.93,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Yes, they're going well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.23,0:05:39.88,Default,Matthis,0,0,0,,I'm glad to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.39,0:05:44.60,Default,Matthis,0,0,0,,Looking at you reminds me \Nof my own granddaughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.97,0:05:48.15,Default,Matthis,0,0,0,,Always remember to take \Ngood care of your health.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.15,0:05:48.95,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.40,0:05:51.94,Default,Matthis,0,0,0,,Steps is a big clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.94,0:05:54.59,Default,Matthis,0,0,0,,If anything goes wrong, \Nask your clanmates for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.59,0:05:58.80,Default,Matthis,0,0,0,,And Krai... Well, depending on \Nthe situation, he may be useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.80,0:06:00.51,Default,Matthis,0,0,0,,Say what you will, but he's raised
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.51,0:06:03.43,Default,Matthis,0,0,0,,his level more than anyone\Nelse in the last few years.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.43,0:06:04.57,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.57,0:06:07.22,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Master is an amazing person.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.50,0:06:10.21,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,He's strict, but he's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.56,0:06:14.54,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,He's got a lot of debt, but he's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.54,0:06:18.21,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Compared to him, I'm really nothing at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.63,0:06:19.72,Default,Matthis,0,0,0,,Good grief...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.72,0:06:21.15,Default,Matthis,0,0,0,,Hey, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.15,0:06:23.33,Default,Matthis,0,0,0,,What the hell are you teaching this girl?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.75,0:06:25.22,Default,Matthis,0,0,0,,Hey. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.22,0:06:27.23,Default,Matthis,0,0,0,,Are you listening?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.24,0:06:27.02,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,A mask?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.50,0:06:28.53,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Could it possibly be...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.53,0:06:30.04,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,A Reversible Face?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.55,0:06:32.73,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,The design does look a little different,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.37,0:06:35.10,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,but this has to be one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.10,0:06:37.11,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,I used to love using these.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.11,0:06:39.65,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Just put it on, and you've \Ngot a different face!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.08,0:06:42.25,Flashback,Liz,0,0,0,,It's creepy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.25,0:06:44.92,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Liz broke the previous one...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.50,0:06:50.50,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,But if I had this, I could freely walk \Noutside without bodyguards again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.87,0:06:53.03,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,I won't be bothered by Arnold.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.03,0:06:55.51,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,I could go to all the \Ndessert shops that I want!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.89,0:06:57.00,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,I want this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.00,0:06:58.50,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,I want it so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.50,0:07:00.02,Default,Matthis,0,0,0,,Hey. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.02,0:07:02.21,Default,Matthis,0,0,0,,You're still not done, boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.21,0:07:04.29,Default,Matthis,0,0,0,,I've got work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.84,0:07:08.42,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I'd like to talk to this item's owner\N and negotiate with them directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.42,0:07:09.80,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Will you contact them for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.80,0:07:10.65,Default,Matthis,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.16,0:07:13.90,Default,Matthis,0,0,0,,It's not appraised yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.67,0:07:16.13,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,That's creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.80,0:07:23.24,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Master, what are you going\N to do about the money?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.24,0:07:25.49,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I finally found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.49,0:07:28.25,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I can't let that relic slip away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.25,0:07:31.13,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I'm sure I can get it cheaper \Nthan at the auction.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.43,0:07:34.88,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,A relic like that could be \Nused for criminal purposes,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.88,0:07:36.91,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,so they don't often appear in stores.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.57,0:07:39.89,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,This is a once-in-a-lifetime chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.89,0:07:41.64,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,I'm so lucky!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.64,0:07:46.69,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Sitri said that she has so many expenses \Nfrom her research these days
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.69,0:07:48.91,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,that she hardly has any money on hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.37,0:07:50.08,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.08,0:07:50.91,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.91,0:07:57.13,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,And she's given the valuable magic-recovery \Npotions she had mass-produced to the mages.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.13,0:07:58.79,Default,Kris,0,0,0,,Urgh... honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.79,0:07:59.60,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.16,0:08:02.63,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,One more to reinvigorate your tired body.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.24,0:08:08.32,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,They must have been the ones\Nshe used for recharging the relics.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.70,0:08:11.16,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,W-Well, I'm sure it'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.16,0:08:13.82,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,It'll work out. It's gotta work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.82,0:08:14.67,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Yes, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.67,0:08:19.15,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,If that armband we handed in to be \Nappraised turns out to be highly valuable,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.15,0:08:21.44,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,that would solve your money problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.44,0:08:23.38,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Well, that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.89,0:08:29.13,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,But if the relic is that rare, \NI'd rather keep it for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.13,0:08:30.36,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,On the other hand...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.36,0:08:31.94,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Cough it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.94,0:08:36.46,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,If I ask Liz, she'll collect money by force.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.08,0:08:42.57,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,It would be great to have another \Noption besides Sitri for a quick loan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.57,0:08:43.46,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.25,0:08:47.96,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,An aristocrat's crest?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.38,0:08:50.58,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,That's the House of the Earl\Nof Gladis, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.58,0:08:53.52,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,He famously hates the hunters,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.52,0:08:55.40,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,so I wonder what he's doing here at Steps?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.95,0:08:55.40,Top,Arc,0,0,0,,Lady Éclair.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.96,0:08:58.04,Default,Arc,0,0,0,,I apologize for being unable to \Nentertain you properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.04,0:08:59.96,Default,Éclair,0,0,0,,Do not worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.24,0:09:05.24,Default,Éclair,0,0,0,,I simply wished to see where \Nyou usually spend your days.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.61,0:09:09.22,Default,Éclair,0,0,0,,I dislike the vulgarity of most\Nhunters, but you're different.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.58,0:09:11.65,Default,Éclair,0,0,0,,You're much more refined.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.65,0:09:15.06,Default,Éclair,0,0,0,,I look forward to studying \Nthe blade with you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.06,0:09:16.98,Default,Arc,0,0,0,,Certainly. It would be my honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.41,0:09:19.25,Default,Éclair,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.68,0:09:21.75,Default,Éclair,0,0,0,,The hell are you looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.75,0:09:22.74,Default,Éclair,0,0,0,,Get lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.10,0:09:26.50,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Y-You think you can talk to Master like th—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.50,0:09:28.00,Default,Arc,0,0,0,,Hello, Krai.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.41,0:09:32.47,Default,Arc,0,0,0,,Allow me to introduce the daughter\N of the Earl of Gladis, Lady Éclair.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.89,0:09:36.76,Default,Arc,0,0,0,,This is our clan master, Krai Andrey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.15,0:09:39.37,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,A pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.34,0:09:43.22,Default,Éclair,0,0,0,,So you're Thousand Tricks?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.22,0:09:46.28,Default,Éclair,0,0,0,,I've heard much about you from my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.04,0:09:51.44,Default,Éclair,0,0,0,,You appear to be as exceptionally\Nweak as I've been told.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.44,0:09:54.63,Default,Éclair,0,0,0,,I find it completely unbelievable \Nthat someone like you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.63,0:09:56.29,Default,Éclair,0,0,0,,could have a higher level than Ark Rodin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.48,0:10:01.17,Default,Éclair,0,0,0,,The Explorers' Association\Nmust truly have fallen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.17,0:10:03.55,Default,Éclair,0,0,0,,Perhaps you bought your level with coin?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.86,0:10:07.41,Default,Éclair,0,0,0,,Your poor upbringing is clearly apparent, you\N ill-mannered lout. Have some sense of shame!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.17,0:10:16.04,Default,Éclair,0,0,0,,You... Why do you remain silent, \Neven after I've berated you so?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.04,0:10:17.62,Default,Éclair,0,0,0,,Have you no pride?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.08,0:10:21.12,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I {\i1}wasn't{\i0} raised well, and I {\i1}am{\i0} ill-mannered,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.12,0:10:23.93,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,so I try to keep my mouth \Nshut as much as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.93,0:10:25.00,Default,Éclair,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.00,0:10:27.61,Default,Éclair,0,0,0,,Oh, uh... Huh... I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.61,0:10:30.13,Default,Éclair,0,0,0,,Th-That's a good way to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.69,0:10:33.79,Default,Butler,0,0,0,,My lady, it is time to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.79,0:10:35.94,Default,Éclair,0,0,0,,O-Oh. Yes, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.53,0:10:37.69,Default,Éclair,0,0,0,,Well then, Ark.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.08,0:10:39.70,Default,Éclair,0,0,0,,Let us meet again!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.20,0:10:41.05,Default,Arc,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.21,0:10:45.02,Default,Arc,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to have sprung that on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.02,0:10:48.20,Default,Arc,0,0,0,,She wanted to bring me back by\Ncarriage, and I couldn't refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.20,0:10:51.03,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,That doesn't matter at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.03,0:10:53.20,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,You returned at the perfect time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.42,0:10:55.71,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Ark... do you have any money?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.71,0:10:56.93,Default,Arc,0,0,0,,Not for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.44,0:11:01.22,Default,Arc,0,0,0,,Let me guess: you laid eyes on a new relic?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.22,0:11:03.61,Default,Arc,0,0,0,,It's almost auction season, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.61,0:11:05.46,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,This is different, Ark!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.73,0:11:07.08,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,It's a dangerous relic.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.08,0:11:08.36,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I really want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.36,0:11:09.98,Default,Arc,0,0,0,,Nothing is different at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.98,0:11:11.20,Default,Arc,0,0,0,,How much do you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.20,0:11:12.26,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Whatever you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.26,0:11:14.63,Default,Arc,0,0,0,,Why do you need that relic? What can it do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.63,0:11:15.77,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,That, I can't tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.77,0:11:17.48,Default,Arc,0,0,0,,Then it's no deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.12,0:11:19.26,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.83,0:11:23.31,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Hey, Sven!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.31,0:11:24.84,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Could you lend me some money?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.84,0:11:26.94,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Or Marietta or Lyle?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.00,0:11:29.73,Top,Krai,0,0,0,,Oh, Thalia is an alchemist, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.22,0:11:33.34,Default,Arc,0,0,0,,Krai really is an amusing guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.58,0:11:35.83,Default,Gossip,0,0,0,,Hey, have you heard?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.83,0:11:39.01,Default,AndThen,0,0,0,,It seems like Thousand Tricks asked \NArk Rodin to lend him money.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.01,0:11:42.22,Default,NoWay,0,0,0,,Sounds like there's a relic \Nhe can't live without.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.22,0:11:43.79,Default,People,0,0,0,,How much could it cost?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.79,0:11:45.24,Default,People,0,0,0,,I'd love to see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.24,0:11:46.40,Default,People,0,0,0,,Thousand Tricks'...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.40,0:11:46.99,Default,People,0,0,0,,...treasure...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.99,0:11:47.93,Default,People,0,0,0,,...an unbelievable...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.93,0:11:48.98,Default,People,0,0,0,,...find!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.98,0:11:49.89,Default,People,0,0,0,,A legendary...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.89,0:11:51.55,Default,People,0,0,0,,...all-powerful relic!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.52,0:11:54.85,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry, Sitri.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.85,0:11:58.46,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,We just talked about how I'd \Nrepay you the other day...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.81,0:12:00.73,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,but I'm already asking for another favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.04,0:12:04.18,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Even to bargain with the \Nrelic's owner for me...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.18,0:12:06.10,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.10,0:12:08.66,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,I mean, it's you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.24,0:12:11.51,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,My research will be delayed a bit,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.51,0:12:14.76,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,but I've sold some of my surplus materials,\N so I have some cash on hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.17,0:12:18.20,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,You want to have this relic \Nat any cost, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.20,0:12:20.25,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Yeah, basically.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.48,0:12:23.90,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,If it's not enough, I'll talk to \Nthe bank about getting a loan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.88,0:12:27.56,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,You really want this relic, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.56,0:12:29.65,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Uh, well. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.94,0:12:32.88,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,We can worry about me later.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.88,0:12:34.84,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,I'll make do until then.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.84,0:12:38.40,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,After all, it's for a relic \Nyou desperately desire.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.36,0:12:44.57,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Well, if it comes down to it, we'll \Njust deal with the relic's owner directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.57,0:12:46.54,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,I'm good at negotiations.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.54,0:12:47.97,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.97,0:12:52.03,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,It has a bit of a disturbing appearance, \Nso I don't think it'll fetch a high price.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.82,0:12:58.11,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,I hope the relic's owner will let us have \Nit for 30 million and call it a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.67,0:13:00.05,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.01,0:13:11.69,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for agreeing to \Nnegotiate with us today, Arnold.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.48,0:13:14.44,Default,Eigh,0,0,0,,I'll just say this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.66,0:13:20.02,Default,Eigh,0,0,0,,That mask is a rare item we brought \Nall the way from the Land of Fog.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.02,0:13:22.19,Default,Eigh,0,0,0,,As you can imagine, it was quite difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.19,0:13:23.95,Default,Eigh,0,0,0,,We won't sell it for cheap.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.37,0:13:26.24,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,I am well aware.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.61,0:13:31.71,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,But I also hear it's creepy and unsightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.10,0:13:36.27,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,And it's not like Krai wants \Nto have it at any cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.83,0:13:40.35,Default,Eigh,0,0,0,,Well, it's not like we're\Ndesperate to sell, either!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.62,0:13:42.41,Default,Eigh,0,0,0,,If you're trying to take advantage of us,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.41,0:13:44.46,Default,Eigh,0,0,0,,we're fine with putting\N it up at the auction.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.46,0:13:46.33,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,I don't mean to be blunt,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.33,0:13:50.57,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,but the nobility won't be \Ninterested in such an unattractive item.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.57,0:13:54.13,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,I'm afraid you aren't likely to\N get a good price for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.13,0:13:55.64,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,This isn't a fair negotiation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.55,0:13:59.35,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,We don't know what that mask can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.66,0:14:03.65,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,But you two must have some idea, \Nwhich is why you want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.65,0:14:06.48,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,Without knowing that, \Nwe cannot name a price.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.48,0:14:09.62,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,Instead of selling it on \Nthe cheap like a total fool,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.62,0:14:12.23,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,I'd rather destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.95,0:14:14.86,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,Answer me, Thousand Tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.86,0:14:16.39,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,What does the mask do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.79,0:14:18.49,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,That I cannot say.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.94,0:14:23.74,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,But if my predictions are right, \Nthat relic is a bit dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.74,0:14:28.23,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Even in this country, there are laws that\N restrict its use. It's best to get rid of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.23,0:14:30.43,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,Then why do {\i1}you{\i0} want it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.30,0:14:34.36,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Well, that's because... well...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.36,0:14:36.93,Internal,Arnold(M),0,0,0,,He is utterly unprepared \Nfor this negotiation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.93,0:14:39.91,Internal,Arnold(M),0,0,0,,He thinks I'll just let it go now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.91,0:14:42.95,Internal,Arnold(M),0,0,0,,Did he really believe he could \Nconvince me like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.42,0:14:44.56,Internal,Arnold(M),0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.56,0:14:45.51,Internal,Arnold(M),0,0,0,,Is it a trap?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.06,0:14:51.63,Internal,Arnold(M),0,0,0,,Could it be that his actual aim \Nis to make us keep the mask?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.87,0:14:57.95,Internal,Arnold(M),0,0,0,,Let's say that mask is actually dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.95,0:14:59.92,Internal,Arnold(M),0,0,0,,Knowing that,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.92,0:15:04.93,Internal,Arnold(M),0,0,0,,Thousand Tricks secretly tried to \Nacquire it before it went up for auction.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.93,0:15:07.80,Internal,Arnold(M),0,0,0,,But when he realized that we owned it,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.80,0:15:10.12,Internal,Arnold(M),0,0,0,,he instantly changed his strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.12,0:15:13.42,Internal,Arnold(M),0,0,0,,By goading us so blatantly \Nto get rid of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.42,0:15:17.10,Internal,Arnold(M),0,0,0,,he's trying to manipulate me\N into holding on to it...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.99,0:15:23.92,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,10 million gil.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.29,0:15:27.79,Default,Eigh,0,0,0,,A-Are you sure, Arnold?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.79,0:15:32.93,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,Yes. According to him, \Nthis relic is a bit dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.48,0:15:35.90,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,Do you have any objections, Thousand Tricks?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.90,0:15:38.97,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Uh, no. None at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.52,0:15:42.78,Internal,Arnold(M),0,0,0,,I have no idea how dangerous \Nthis relic actually is,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.78,0:15:45.20,Internal,Arnold(M),0,0,0,,but we can't use it either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.70,0:15:49.40,Internal,Arnold(M),0,0,0,,Dancing to his tune and holding \Non to it would be the worst move.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.72,0:15:54.47,Internal,Arnold(M),0,0,0,,In which case, naming a high price that\Nhe can't refuse is the best course of action.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.83,0:15:56.97,Internal,Arnold(M),0,0,0,,You thought you fooled us,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.97,0:15:59.37,Internal,Arnold(M),0,0,0,,but too bad, Thousand Tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.37,0:16:01.67,Internal,Arnold(M),0,0,0,,Your pathetic face says it all:
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.67,0:16:05.24,Internal,Arnold(M),0,0,0,,I'm the winner here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.68,0:16:08.25,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,You think it's okay for \Nus to get it this cheap?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.25,0:16:09.90,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.90,0:16:12.21,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,They made the offer, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.81,0:16:16.26,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.26,0:16:18.85,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,The deal is 10 million gil for the relic.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.85,0:16:20.48,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,We'll pay in cash right no—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.59,0:16:21.72,Top,Stop,0,0,0,,Stop right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.99,0:16:23.50,Default,Eigh,0,0,0,,Stop right there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.78,0:16:24.95,Default,Double,0,0,0,,I'll give you double!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.95,0:16:26.32,Default,Double,0,0,0,,Please sell it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.32,0:16:28.28,Default,Raise,0,0,0,,I'll give you 20.5 million!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.28,0:16:29.88,Default,EvenMore,0,0,0,,20.8 million!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.88,0:16:31.35,Default,ReRaise,0,0,0,,In that case, 30 million!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.35,0:16:33.33,Default,MMore,0,0,0,,30.2 million here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.33,0:16:35.08,Default,Basar,0,0,0,,30.5 million!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.08,0:16:36.77,Default,Éclair,0,0,0,,100 million gil.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.04,0:16:43.77,Default,Éclair,0,0,0,,I, Éclair Gladis, will buy \Nthis all-powerful relic.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.77,0:16:44.91,Default,Éclair,0,0,0,,Any complaints?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.84,0:16:49.74,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,And this is why I hate the nobility.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.02,0:16:53.02,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.35,0:16:55.70,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,How did this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.02,0:16:59.24,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,Rumors began to spread saying you asked
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.24,0:17:01.60,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,Ark and the others for a loan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.60,0:17:04.92,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,And that it was to purchase a\N unique, all-powerful relic.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.36,0:17:07.07,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,So it's going on auction after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.07,0:17:08.05,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.68,0:17:13.07,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,The local authorities deemed \Na direct sale logistically unfeasible.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.07,0:17:15.80,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,The hubbub caught the eye \Nof aristocrats and merchants,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.80,0:17:18.35,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,so they will be in the running as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.94,0:17:22.36,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,Apparently, it's guaranteed to\N sell for over 100 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.36,0:17:23.32,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.32,0:17:24.46,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.18,0:17:26.69,Flashback,Matthis,0,0,0,,It cannot be appraised!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.69,0:17:28.69,Flashback,Matthis,0,0,0,,The risk factor of using it is S!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.69,0:17:33.20,Flashback,Matthis,0,0,0,,Tens or hundreds of millions for \Nthis frightening mask of dubious use?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.90,0:17:36.95,Flashback,Matthis,0,0,0,,Why did you let rumors lead you astray?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.24,0:17:40.71,Flashback,Matthis,0,0,0,,There's no relic that can \Nmake you all-powerful!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.21,0:17:45.86,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Who even started saying this \Nrelic was all-powerful?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.86,0:17:51.17,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,The only use for it is to go to dessert\Nshops without anyone knowing...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.51,0:17:54.96,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,So what will you do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.96,0:17:56.58,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.98,0:18:00.98,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Okay, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.98,0:18:03.19,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I can't go taking on more debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.19,0:18:04.91,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.91,0:18:08.99,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,At any rate, you need to hold off \Non buying more relics and such.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.18,0:18:11.98,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Krai, I got the money!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.36,0:18:15.74,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Let's give them a proper fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.18,0:18:18.24,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,I kept it a secret from my big sister,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.56,0:18:21.49,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,but I've been saving up funds\N for our wedding, Krai.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.98,0:18:24.12,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,It's 800 million gil.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.12,0:18:25.50,Default,Both,0,0,0,,800 million?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.90,0:18:28.74,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,The money was always for Krai, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.97,0:18:32.76,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,So I was thinking we could \Nuse it a bit earlier...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.25,0:18:36.15,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,Enough is enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.15,0:18:40.47,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,Virtually all party breakups are \Ndue to financial or romantic quarrels!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.47,0:18:43.77,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,Not to mention, your enabling\Nhim is why Krai is so undisciplined.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.29,0:18:45.36,Top,Sitri,0,0,0,,Undisciplined or whatever else he may be,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.36,0:18:47.85,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,I'll take him in, so no need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.85,0:18:49.59,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,That's not what this is about!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.59,0:18:53.13,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,I'm saying, please do not allow our \Nclan master to go further into debt!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.13,0:18:55.78,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,Even Krai has to think about his standing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.78,0:18:58.77,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,And this is why I hate \N the nobility and merchants!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.01,0:19:01.37,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,Your preferences aren't \Nwhat matters here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.76,0:19:04.78,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,I don't like all this strife.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.48,0:19:07.82,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,It should all be love and peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.79,0:19:14.42,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Krai, do you want to go \Nscout out that rich girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.42,0:19:18.98,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Maybe we can win her over if we figure\Nout why she wants the relic herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.98,0:19:20.43,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Oh, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.43,0:19:21.69,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Let's do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.05,0:19:23.42,Top,Eva,0,0,0,,{\fs18}I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.47,0:19:29.44,Default,Éclair,0,0,0,,You have quite the nerve to show up \Nhere so brazenly, Thousand Tricks!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.70,0:19:33.63,Default,Éclair,0,0,0,,I see that your courage \Ncould even rival Ark's.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.63,0:19:38.31,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,No, no. The only place where \NI exceed Ark is in level.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.58,0:19:43.03,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,There is talk of Ark and \Nmyself being rivals,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.03,0:19:44.83,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,but it's not like that at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.83,0:19:46.71,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,We're on completely \Ndifferent playing fields.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.71,0:19:48.58,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,He's just a friend to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.58,0:19:49.96,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,A friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.96,0:19:51.07,Default,Éclair,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.33,0:19:53.71,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Don't be so humble.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.71,0:19:58.34,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Well, I guess the treasure vaults we \Ncomplete are always higher than his.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.63,0:20:01.10,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,But I think Ark still wins.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.10,0:20:04.31,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Krai, whose side are you on?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.31,0:20:07.17,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I mean, I'm on your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.86,0:20:11.35,Default,Éclair,0,0,0,,I understand what you two came here to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.58,0:20:15.15,Default,Éclair,0,0,0,,You came here to mock Ark!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.35,0:20:18.60,Default,Éclair,0,0,0,,You scrounged together all those relics,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.60,0:20:21.90,Default,Éclair,0,0,0,,then used their power \Nto achieve your level 8!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.90,0:20:25.36,Default,Éclair,0,0,0,,Your strength is false— \Nnothing but borrowed power!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.36,0:20:29.99,Default,Éclair,0,0,0,,I swear, I will definitely give \Nthat all-powerful relic to Ark!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.99,0:20:32.30,Default,Éclair,0,0,0,,Your days at the top are numbered!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.30,0:20:33.06,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,That wouldn't help.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.06,0:20:33.62,Default,Éclair,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.62,0:20:38.06,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Speaking as his friend, \NArk won't be happy to get such a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.46,0:20:41.25,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,One relic alone wont make you the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.65,0:20:44.55,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,The strong are strong with or without relics.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.55,0:20:46.25,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,And the weak are weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.57,0:20:47.67,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.67,0:20:50.17,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Even without relics, Ark is strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.17,0:20:51.76,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,And even with relics, I'm weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.10,0:20:53.41,Default,Éclair,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.41,0:20:54.78,Default,Éclair,0,0,0,,Shut up, shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.78,0:20:56.36,Default,Éclair,0,0,0,,You're an idiot! A total idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.36,0:20:58.53,Default,Éclair,0,0,0,,You think I'm going to let us lose to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.53,0:21:01.94,Default,Éclair,0,0,0,,I'm going to get that relic for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.94,0:21:03.84,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,We have readied 200 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.28,0:21:06.76,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,You have 100 million...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.09,0:21:11.66,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Even the daughter of the House of Gladis \Nmust have some limit on her spending.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.66,0:21:13.71,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,It would be wise to give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.58,0:21:17.27,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,This is our absolute limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.84,0:21:19.79,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,If you're prepared to spend more than that,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.34,0:21:22.81,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,we will admit defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.24,0:21:28.30,Default,Earl Gladis,0,0,0,,You are competing against Thousand Tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.70,0:21:32.24,Default,Earl Gladis,0,0,0,,Yet for us to back down now would be a stain \Non the name of the House of Gladis.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.24,0:21:34.34,Default,Earl Gladis,0,0,0,,Our ancestors would never forgive us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.14,0:21:37.81,Default,Earl Gladis,0,0,0,,Montaure, how much can we use?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.14,0:21:41.11,Default,Montaure,0,0,0,,We can spend 500 million \Nfrom this house's savings.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.11,0:21:43.88,Default,Montaure,0,0,0,,Another 500 million could be \Nloaned from the Welz Trading Company.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.28,0:21:48.11,Default,Montaure,0,0,0,,We'd incur quite a lot of interest, \Nbut we could procure even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.11,0:21:50.07,Default,Éclair,0,0,0,,Father, please wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.33,0:21:52.83,Default,Éclair,0,0,0,,That woman has an absolute \Nupper limit of 200 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.83,0:21:55.72,Default,Éclair,0,0,0,,If we can put up a little more \Nthan 200 million, I can win.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.72,0:21:59.91,Default,Montaure,0,0,0,,Nobody would honestly reveal \Ntheir hand to a competitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.52,0:22:03.53,Default,Montaure,0,0,0,,You're going up against \NThousand Tricks and his ilk.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.03,0:22:06.84,Default,Montaure,0,0,0,,It's doubtful even 1 billion\N would be enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.81,0:22:09.47,Default,Earl,0,0,0,,Make no mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.47,0:22:10.85,Default,Earl,0,0,0,,This is only a loan.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.85,0:22:13.28,Default,Earl,0,0,0,,I will not tolerate frivolous spending.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.28,0:22:14.19,Default,Éclair,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.73,0:22:17.90,Default,Earl,0,0,0,,Éclair, you had better win this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.21,0:22:21.23,Default,Earl,0,0,0,,That is an order.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.52,0:22:23.76,Default,Earl,0,0,0,,The House of Gladis has no use for losers.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.00,0:22:27.48,Default,Earl,0,0,0,,Bear full responsibility \Nfor this and go win!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.09,0:22:29.09,Default,Éclair,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.86,0:22:35.11,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Man, this has gotten so weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.11,0:22:37.06,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,An auction isn't a war.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.43,0:22:39.50,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,It's a joyous festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.50,0:22:43.00,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Which is why, once it ends, \Nwe need to throw a party.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.89,0:22:45.87,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,On Ark's tab!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.19,0:23:29.67,Default,All,0,0,0,,Zebrudia Auction!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.67,0:23:31.18,Top,Sitri,0,0,0,,The total debt is in the billions!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.68,0:23:44.69,EpTitle,txt,0,0,0,,{\fs15\pos(503.016,355.111)}By: The Grieving Heroines?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.18,0:23:32.80,Top,Liz,0,0,0,,We're facing the auction of chaos!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.80,0:23:34.32,Top,Tino,0,0,0,,It rains, it floods. \NAnyway, it's a mission!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.32,0:23:35.75,Top,All,0,0,0,,Zebrudia Auction!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.75,0:23:37.26,Top,All,0,0,0,,Zebrudia Auction!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.75,0:23:37.26,Top,Sitri,0,0,0,,From one to the next...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.26,0:23:38.96,Top,Tino,0,0,0,,They're put up for sale!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.96,0:23:40.38,Top,Liz,0,0,0,,The very, very enticing...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.38,0:23:41.99,Top,Both,0,0,0,,Collection!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.99,0:23:42.51,Top,Tino,0,0,0,,Next time!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.51,0:23:43.56,Top,Liz,0,0,0,,On {\i1}Let This Grieving Soul{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.56,0:23:44.35,Top,Sitri,0,0,0,,...{\i1}Retire{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.35,0:23:45.24,Top,Tino,0,0,0,,Now this is what I call...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.69,0:23:49.98,EpTitle,title,0,0,0,,{\c&H00BAFF&\pos(320.52,100.623)}Episode 13
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.69,0:23:49.98,EpTitle,title,0,0,0,,{\fs30\bord3\pos(322.143,238.714)\c&HD1D1D1&}I Want to Win the Bid No Matter What
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.24,0:23:46.37,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,...the {\i1}Krai{\i0}max!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.37,0:23:47.06,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Ew.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.06,0:23:49.25,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,"I Want to Win the Bid No Matter What"!
